{"unit_id":"louisyeaaah__dsh-doctor#feature-feature-1","repo":"louisyeaaah/dsh-doctor","commit":"8b04aa831ae05758b75ebc2f0ea916ce557cabd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-doctor 的功能「插件行诊断」：读取 Loader 中的插件行，区分运行中、未运行和 disabled 状态，并列出未运行原因及下一步排查方向。通过工具调用或 /dsh-doctor 命令触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/collect.js:25-71","lib/render.js:21-45"]}
